        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=3$",
          "worked": "At the $y$-intercept, $x=0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}6&=a(0-2)^2-6\\\\6&=4a-6\\\\4a&=12\\\\a&=3\\end{align*}$$",
